window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Life was never what it seemed… and neither was she. Darla always felt like something was missing. Ever since her childhood best friend—the boy next door she secretly loved—disappeared, she’s been lost. But now he’s back, and he’s come for her. Only, he’s not the same boy she remembers. He’s changed.</p> <p>Leaving everything behind, Darla follows him—only to discover a mysterious necklace in her pocket, unlocking powers she never knew she had. Powers that had been deliberately hidden from her. Thrown into a world she doesn’t understand, Darla must learn to control her newfound abilities.</p> <p>But just as she begins to grasp her place in this strange new reality, she loses him again. This time, she’s not alone. Twin brothers take her in, offering protection and answers about the dangers that lurk in the shadows. Darla is one of a kind. The only one of her kind.</p> <p>As dark, soulless creatures hunt her, determined to claim her power, she faces an impossible choice: fight against a fate designed to consume her… or risk becoming the very thing she fears.</p>"; 
